{{Quote|Provides sticky and flexible dough-based attacks.|Shop}}
'''Dough''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|2,800,000}} or {{Robux|2,400}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Dough enables the user to create, become and manipulate pastry dough, delivering sharp and sticky attacks that deal significant damage, with moves ranging from tall, hardened spikes to destructive melee attacks visually enhanced by [[Aura]].

==Awakening==
Dough costs {{Fragment|18,500}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]].

The "{{Title|Bread Chaser}}" [[Titles|title]] #045 will be granted upon awakening at least one ability of this fruit. 

{{Awakening Price Table
